{"title":"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> which satisfy the inequality:\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced9beddeacb856f71f58a3de06d4bb433e67065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1}}&gt;\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"189\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>(Note that the problem as written in the official PDF <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.imo-official.org/year_info.aspx?year=1962\">https://www.imo-official.org/year_info.aspx?year=1962</a> does not have the outer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df0a685a243dc069ee17c36ebf70dba32575ca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\ }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"23\" height=\"21\" />)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Obviously we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46e8a418d055cff49402fe244c29f155e66e3e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3-x} \\geq \\sqrt{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" /> for the outer square root to be defined, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/b/e5bdb15315f61988cb6d0102343dd6fc65cdb497.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> for the first inner square root to be defined,\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e0725a545fccf10b73153e6a64a156e243324cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\geq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> for the second inner square root to be defined. Solving these we get that the left hand side is defined for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd1b79ebaa2f316e8a4640efe60a54f02a4bdcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in \\left[ -1,1 \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now obviously the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c6bdfbb3fb99efc5fd32f1298012b3165fae528.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\sqrt{\\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"213\" height=\"32\" /> is continuous on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a708526a0b1155ed2e4160fbada368658987d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[ -1,1 \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4ae6c66b7fb6a476b7389a57ff830d2a6fd26b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-1)=\\sqrt 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />.\nMoreover, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/3058f436e4c0042bcaf21e10b75d2d0f39eb0375.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-x$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> is a decreasing and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> an increasing function, both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b19324e3cd6e50b9e5ad13f65cf0e39f2fe1da33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b0f08698a7459345d1edb0b0eab5e92248ef5c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sqrt{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> are decreasing functions, and hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a decreasing function. Therefore there is exactly one solution to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15d0e277679e9859e6ee843297266b5af7ce3f6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>We can now find this solution:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf355030a218546031116e1be27be2e520f0fc7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\sqrt{\\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1}} &amp;= \\dfrac{1}{2} \\\\ \\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1} &amp;= \\dfrac{1}{4} \\\\ \\sqrt{3-x} &amp;= \\dfrac{1}{4} + \\sqrt{x+1} \\\\ 3-x &amp;= \\dfrac 1{16} + x+1 + \\dfrac{\\sqrt{x+1}}2 \\\\ 2 - 2x - \\dfrac 1{16} &amp;= \\dfrac{\\sqrt{x+1}}2 \\\\ 31 - 32x &amp;= 8\\sqrt{x+1} \\\\ 1024 x^2 - 1984x + 961 &amp;= 64(x+1) \\\\ 1024 x^2 - 2048x + 897 &amp;= 0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"363\" height=\"298\" />\n</p><p>(Note the little trick in the third row: placing the square roots on opposite sides of the equation. Squaring the equation in the second row would work as well, but this way is a little more pleasant, as the one remaining square root after the squaring will essentially be one of the original two, not their product.)\n</p><p>Solving the quadratic equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3062ec05c3326e033a0888e9447c53feb71ecd1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{1,2}=\\dfrac{ 2^{11} \\pm \\sqrt{ 2^{22} - 2^{12}\\cdot 897} }{2^{11}} = 1 \\pm \\dfrac{\\sqrt{127}}{32}\\]\" width=\"325\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>The reason why we got two roots is that while solving the original equation we squared both sides twice, and this could have created additional solutions. In this case, obviously the root that is larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the additional solution, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/6/146c8c597dc1610462547b5166c13b87d3e207d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{127}}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"41\" /> is the root we need.\n</p><p>Hence the solutions to the given inequality are precisely the reals in the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50f174d78eb37ae8eb802ba1d51ac6a22de32d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\left[ ~ -1,\\quad 1-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{127}}{32} ~ \\right) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"181\" height=\"64\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b4208ee4ea18baca0541febbbfa64873d607434c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(300,300,IgnoreAspect);  real f(real x) {return sqrt( sqrt(3-x) - sqrt(x+1) );}; real g(real x) {return 1/2;};  draw(graph(f,-1,1),blue,&quot;$f(x)=\\sqrt{\\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1}}$&quot;); draw(graph(g,-1,1),red,&quot;$g(x)=1/2$&quot;);  xaxis(&quot;$x$&quot;,BottomTop,Ticks); yaxis(&quot;$y$&quot;,LeftRight,Ticks);  attach(legend(),point(E),20E,UnFill);  [/asy]\" width=\"882\" height=\"502\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first do some substitution, Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/2/0b28fe3d45f091a212c6dde1b224f7f46717b23e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\sqrt{3-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/9/d999353b1c30b4accf7acc2c8083c34318b83edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />, and the expression becomes: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e2280c543ee55cb82ba251aa55befd430d5a69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a-\\sqrt{4-a^2}} &gt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"152\" height=\"40\" />. Squaring both sides, we have: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/760060b88effa6ea0d66b4e9938af9944a6ad33c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a-\\sqrt{4-a^2} &gt; \\frac{1}{4} \\Rightarrow 4a-1&gt;4\\sqrt{4-a^2} \\Rightarrow 16a^2-8a+1&gt;16(4-a^2) \\Rightarrow 32a^2-8a-63 &gt; 0\\]\" width=\"669\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Solving yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed97b706dd0acab129707cced07503e1cd428589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; \\frac{1-\\sqrt{127}}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/7/9870206842ddf777f72687e05bb98ab3fcbc0fe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; \\frac{1+\\sqrt{127}}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Substituting back for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/3/39337c18d12d130f198dd7fa539264d119f63942.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{1-\\sqrt{127}}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4380532c8eb7c7ddbd45bf7ade2a3053cac2971.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{1+\\sqrt{127}}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"43\" />. This is two solutions, however, note that for the square root to be determinant, we need to have:\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e39cd30c9642a05c435c1c9d529e7a6eed486c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/7617f9ea1bc64653c5e4b0612b4eb1c98c790044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7db9a583e0cb483f4fbe56389e96aea26b6a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3-x}-\\sqrt{x+1} \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow 3-x \\geq x+1 \\Rightarrow x \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"379\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Obviously, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4380532c8eb7c7ddbd45bf7ade2a3053cac2971.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{1+\\sqrt{127}}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"43\" /> conflicted with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9afbaa16cfe6f80af3e0aad0641fcbe60dcae2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />, and the lower bound for x is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/7617f9ea1bc64653c5e4b0612b4eb1c98c790044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />, so our final solution is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce7cbc7d05773ab2f6dc82960de035f0d44118e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{x \\in \\left[ ~ -1,\\quad 1-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{127}}{32} ~ \\right) }\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"65\" />\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:IDKHowtoaddsolution&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:IDKHowtoaddsolution (page does not exist)\">IDKHowtoaddsolution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO\" title=\"1962 IMO\">1962 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163949\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 239/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8407/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.789      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.789      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7540:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163949 and revision id 259750. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}